add("abvm-d19250a6dc37f78313e5","religion","Religion","religion-image-likeness","According to the current Religion lesson, which pair correctly connects a lesson idea with its supporting detail?",{"God's image and likeness → people can think, choose, and love","Trinity → people use five senses to enjoy creation","Disciples → three Persons in one God"},1,"The current lesson specifically links God's image and likeness with the abilities to think, choose, and love.","Choose the pair whose two parts are directly connected in the current lesson.",3,"current","auto-religion-image-likeness-god-s-image-and-likeness-people-can-think-choose-and-love-2af68f")
