add("abvm-d5c775f00c402c88467f","religion","Religion","religion-jesus-savior","According to the current Religion lesson, which two ideas are connected in the explanation of Jesus as our Savior?",{"He is Mary’s son and people have five senses.","He died for our sins and gives us new life in grace.","Creation has gifts and disciples are friends."},2,"The lesson directly connects salvation from sin with the gift of new life in grace.","Choose the pair that the current lesson joins in its explanation of Savior.",3,"current","auto-religion-jesus-savior-he-died-for-our-sins-and-gives-us-new-life-in-grace-89c106")
